OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Blood launch new album with
OL,4,A5k Brighton run
OL,5,
OL,6,FSussex band Royal Blood have launched
OL,7,Ftheir new album with a 5km run through
OL,8,Fthe streets of Brighton.
OL,10,FSinger and guitarist Mike Kerr gave up
OL,11,Fdrugs and alcohol in 2019, and
OL,12,Fdescribed the challenge of running as
OL,13,F"a part of that journey" to stay sober.
OL,15,FHe said running had been a large part
OL,16,Fof the song-writing process on the new
OL,17,Falbum, Dead Company.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
