OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Blood launch new album with
OL,4,A5k Brighton run
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We were writing these really heavy,
OL,7,Ffull-on songs and I was going out and
OL,8,Ftraining but then I was also bringing
OL,9,Fthis refreshed energy from running into
OL,10,Fthe writing sessions," Kerr said.
